          "body_html": "Andrew didn't start with aesthetics — he started with a load specification. Every structural decision in the Atlas exists to protect what's inside. The rigid polymer skeleton, the full-front impact shield, the crush-proof nose bridge — none of it is decorative. <em>This is how an aircraft engineer builds a case.</em>"
