          "body_html": "The outer shell is Full-Grain Vachetta leather, sourced and vegetable-tanned in Greece using an ancient process that lets the hide breathe. It arrives pale and unassuming. Over time it deepens into a patina that belongs to no one else. <em>It doesn't wear out. It wears in.</em>"
